 sonic_synastry: `One chart's Uranus and the other's Sun sixty degrees apart produce a shared texture where purposeful direction and innovative awakening support each other naturally. The Sun's directional clarity is given Uranus's capacity for unexpected insight without being destabilized by it. The shared composition moves with purpose that includes genuine originality, direction that discovers new territory along the way without losing structural coherence. The identity has innovation available to it. The innovation has stable identity to work from.`,
 core_synastry: 'Their Uranus finds a productive channel into your Sun. Their innovative energy and your sense of identity work in compatible modes, and their disruption tends to expand rather than threaten your self-concept.',
