 core_synastry: `Uranus opposite Pluto between these charts means one person's disruptive principle and the other person's transformative principle are at maximum distance. Revolution and death-and-rebirth are geometrically opposed.`,
 behavioral_synastry: `When one person's Uranus wants revolutionary disruption, the other person's Pluto wants total transformation. The opposition means both forms of power are legitimate but geometrically incompatible.`,
 friendship_synastry: `One friend's Uranus opposes the other friend's Pluto. Disruptive innovation and transformative intensity are at full polarity.`,
 romantic_synastry: `One partner's Uranus stands opposite the other's Pluto. Change through disruption and change through transformation are at maximum distance. The work is holding both without forcing them to merge.`,
 core_transit: `Transiting Uranus opposes your natal Pluto, maximum distance between disruption and transformation. What breaks pattern and what demands death-and-rebirth are pulling in opposite directions during this multi-year period. The opposition holds both as equally real.`,
 behavioral_transit: `You see clearly which impulses are Uranus seeking innovation and which are your Pluto demanding transformation. Use this window to recognize which situations need revolutionary disruption and which need total death-and-rebirth. The work is conscious choice about which form of power the moment requires.`
